THAT SOMEONE WHO BELIEVED IN

00:03:41.453 --> 00:03:48.127
YOUNG PEOPLE AND HE HAS HELPED

00:03:42.955 --> 00:03:48.861
ME EVER SINCE, COACHING THROUGH

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:50.562
