&gt;&gt; Laura: REVEREND ROBERTSON,

00:03:56.735 --> 00:04:00.339
I NEED TO HEAR FROM YOU ON THIS

00:03:58.237 --> 00:04:03.175
BECAUSE YOU HAVE BEEN FRIENDS

00:04:00.473 --> 00:04:03.509
WITH REVEREND GRAHAM FOR MANY

00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:06.412
