00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:19.092
LET’S LISTEN.

00:04:18.558 --> 00:04:21.994
&gt;&gt; NUMBER ONE NIGHT IN THE

00:04:19.225 --> 00:04:26.199
HOSPITAL, TWO NIGHTS IN THE

00:04:22.128 --> 00:04:27.400
HOSPITAL, I THOUGHT I WAS DYING.

