00:04:38.645 --> 00:04:45.819
AND I ASKED THE LORD TO GIVE ME

00:04:42.715 --> 00:04:46.986
PEACE IN MY HEART, AND HE DID, A

00:04:45.952 --> 00:04:49.055
WONDERFUL PIECE THAT HASN’T LEFT

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:51.024
ME UNTIL THIS DAY.

00:04:49.189 --> 00:04:51.424
THAT HAS BEEN NEARLY TWO YEARS

00:04:51.157 --> 00:04:52.859
AGO.

00:04:51.558 --> 00:04:53.927
&gt;&gt; Laura: REVEREND ROBERTSON,

00:04:52.993 --> 00:04:57.097
YOUR COMMENT ON THAT?

