00:05:19.653 --> 00:05:22.089
I NEED GOD’S FORGIVENESS.

00:05:20.721 --> 00:05:22.389
HE ALWAYS TALKED ABOUT THE

00:05:22.222 --> 00:05:26.226
CROSS.

00:05:22.523 --> 00:05:27.928
HE NEVER       TOOK IT FOR HIMS.

