00:05:44.078 --> 00:05:48.816
THAT’S THE THING THAT STRUCK TO

00:05:47.281 --> 00:05:50.151
ME.

00:05:48.949 --> 00:05:51.419
I WAS WITH HIM AT THE FALL OF

00:05:50.284 --> 00:05:52.920
THE BERLIN WALL.

