HE’S A DEAR DEAR FRIEND FOR MANY

00:05:56.424 --> 00:06:02.930
YEARS, BUT ALWAYS HUMBLE.

00:05:58.826 --> 00:06:03.798
NEVER, EVER DID HE TAKE ANY

00:06:03.064 --> 00:06:04.966
HEIRS TO HIMSELF THAT HE WAS

00:06:03.931 --> 00:06:06.167
SOME KIND OF A HOT SHOT.

00:06:05.099 --> 00:06:08.303
HE WAS.

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:16.511
HE WAS THE PREEMINENT

00:06:08.436 --> 00:06:17.211
EVANGELICAL IN THE WORLD.

