00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:31.426
&gt;&gt; Laura: YOUR GRANDFATHER,

00:06:28.757 --> 00:06:33.595
YOU SAID THAT YOU DIDN’T REALLY

00:06:31.559 --> 00:06:38.533
