BIT OLDER JUST HOW IMPORTANT HE

00:06:38.667 --> 00:06:43.605
WAS BECAUSE OF WHAT RICK AND PAT

00:06:41.736 --> 00:06:45.574
JUST SAID, HIS DEEP SENSE OF

00:06:43.738 --> 00:06:47.409
HUMILITY, WHICH WAS SO

00:06:45.707 --> 00:06:47.976
ATTRACTIVE.

00:06:47.542 --> 00:06:50.412
HUMILITY IS POWERFUL.

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:50.879
I THOUGHT IT WAS SO POWERFUL IN

00:06:50.545 --> 00:06:53.015
HIM.

00:06:51.013 --> 00:06:55.751
&gt;&gt; IT WAS.

00:06:53.148 --> 00:06:58.086
AND I THINK IS ONE OF HIS

00:06:55.884 --> 00:06:59.288
GRANDSONS, WE GOT TO SEE

00:06:58.220 --> 00:07:00.856
PERSPECTIVE, WE GET TO SEE HIM

00:06:59.421 --> 00:07:01.423
IN WAYS THAT NOBODY ELSE GOT TO

00:07:00.989 --> 00:07:02.591
SEE HIM.

00:07:01.557 --> 00:07:05.928
AND I CAN TELL YOU THAT THE

00:07:02.724 --> 00:07:07.229
HUMILITY THAT THE PUBLIC SAW WE

00:07:06.061 --> 00:07:08.764
SAW IN PRIVATE.

00:07:07.363 --> 00:07:11.233
HE IS GENUINELY THE MOST HUMBLE

00:07:08.897 --> 00:07:11.533
PERSON I HAVE EVER MET IN MY

00:07:11.367 --> 00:07:13.168
LIFE.

00:07:11.667 --> 00:07:14.470
I REMEMBER ASKING HIM ONE TIME,

00:07:13.302 --> 00:07:17.506
DADDY BILL, THAT’S WHAT WE

00:07:14.603 --> 00:07:18.540
CALLED HIM, I SAID DADDY BILL,

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:19.241
HOW IN THE WORLD HAVE YOU REMAIN

00:07:18.674 --> 00:07:22.044
SO HUMBLE IN LIGHT OF ALL OF

00:07:19.375 --> 00:07:22.845
YOUR ACCOMPLISHMENTS AND IN

00:07:22.178 --> 00:07:23.579
LIGHT OF ALL OF THE ADULATION

00:07:22.978 --> 00:07:25.815
AND PRAISE THAT YOU RECEIVE ANY

00:07:23.712 --> 00:07:26.816
LOOKED AT ME KIND OF PUZZLED.

00:07:25.948 --> 00:07:28.184
HE DIDN’T LIKE THE FACT THAT HE

00:07:26.949 --> 00:07:30.186
EVEN SAID HE WAS HUMBLE, BECAUSE

00:07:28.317 --> 00:07:31.420
HE DID NOT THINK HE WAS HUMBLE

00:07:30.319 --> 00:07:33.022
AT ALL.

00:07:31.554 --> 00:07:35.191
BUT HE SAID IT’S HARD TO BE

00:07:33.155 --> 00:07:35.858
PROUD WHEN YOU BEGIN EACH DAY

00:07:35.324 --> 00:07:37.226
WITH GOD.

00:07:35.992 --> 00:07:40.396
WHEN YOU BEGIN EACH DAY WITH GOD

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:41.230
YOU REALIZE THAT GOD IS BIG AND

00:07:40.530 --> 00:07:42.632
I AM SMALL.

00:07:41.364 --> 00:07:44.133
GOD IS GOD AND I AM NOT.

00:07:42.765 --> 00:07:46.836
I THINK IT WAS, EVEN FOR US

00:07:44.267 --> 00:07:48.471
FAMILY MEMBERS, IT WAS REALLY

00:07:47.537 --> 00:07:50.006
HIS HUMILITY THAT LEFT THE

00:07:48.604 --> 00:07:51.574
DEEPEST IMPRESSION ON ALL OF US.

00:07:50.139 --> 00:07:55.211
BUT IT WAS ALSO HIS MESSAGE.

00:07:51.708 --> 00:07:55.878
I THINK ONE OF THE THINGS THAT

00:07:55.345 --> 00:07:57.714
SEPARATES HIM FROM SO MANY

00:07:56.012 --> 00:08:02.085
DIFFERENT RELIGIOUS LEADERS,

00:07:57.847 --> 00:08:05.422
EVEN CHRISTIAN LEADERS, IS THE

00:08:02.218 --> 00:08:07.757
IDEA THAT HE PREACHED SO

00:08:05.555 --> 00:08:09.793
PASSIONATELY THE IDEA THAT THE

00:08:07.891 --> 00:08:11.528
ESSENCE, THE FOUNDATION OF

00:08:09.926 --> 00:08:15.398
CHRISTIANITY IS NOT WHAT WE DO

00:08:11.661 --> 00:08:16.266
FOR GOD, IT’S WHAT GOD IN CHRIST

00:08:15.532 --> 00:08:19.202
HAS DONE FOR US.

00:08:16.399 --> 00:08:22.005
AND I THINK THAT IS A HUGE, HUGE

00:08:19.336 --> 00:08:25.542
THING TO SAY, BUT IT WAS ALL

00:08:22.139 --> 00:08:26.743
ABOUT CHRIST FINISHED WORK ON

00:08:25.675 --> 00:08:27.844
OUR BEHALF THAT WE DON’T HAVE TO

00:08:26.877 --> 00:08:30.580
ADD WHAT GOD HAS ALREADY DONE

00:08:27.978 --> 00:08:33.216
FOR US, THAT GOD HAS ALREADY

00:08:30.714 --> 00:08:34.952
GRANTED US HIS APPROVAL IN HIS

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:36.520
ACCEPTANCE AND HIS LOVE BECAUSE

00:08:35.085 --> 00:08:46.263
OF WHAT JESUS HAS DONE FOR US.

00:08:36.653 --> 00:08:46.597
THE MAN OF COURSE SPEAKS

00:08:46.396 --> 00:08:47.331
VOLUMES.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:47.765
HIS HUMILITY, HIS FAITHFULNESS,

00:08:47.464 --> 00:08:48.298
HIS DEVOTION.

00:08:47.898 --> 00:08:48.966
HE WAS A FAMILY MAN.

00:08:48.432 --> 00:08:49.867
HE WAS KEENLY DEVOTED TO HIS

00:08:49.099 --> 00:08:51.368
FAMILY, BUT THEN HIS MESSAGE.

00:08:51.502 --> 00:08:55.806
ODD QUESTION, WAS HE FUNNY?

00:08:54.171 --> 00:08:57.474
I KNOW PAT WILL KNOW THIS, BUT

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:59.743
THAT HE HAD A SENSE OF HUMOR?

00:08:57.608 --> 00:09:01.545
HE SEEMS LIKE MOST OF THE TIME

00:08:59.877 --> 00:09:03.681
SO SERIOUS AND BLACK AND WHITE.

00:09:01.679 --> 00:09:05.015
I LOVE THAT.

00:09:03.814 --> 00:09:07.017
WAS HE FUNNY?

00:09:05.149 --> 00:09:07.685
DID HE GOOF AROUND?

00:09:07.151 --> 00:09:09.887
&gt;&gt; I THINK THE FUNNIEST PART

00:09:07.818 --> 00:09:11.389
ABOUT DADDY BILL IS THAT HE

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:12.823
DIDN’T REALIZE HE WAS FUNNY.

00:09:11.522 --> 00:09:13.491
THAT WAS THE FUNNY THING.

00:09:12.957 --> 00:09:15.493
I THINK WE SPENT MOST OF OUR

00:09:13.624 --> 00:09:19.330
TIME LAUGHING AT HIM RATHER THAN

00:09:15.626 --> 00:09:21.232
LAUGHING WITH HIM BECAUSE -- HE

00:09:19.463 --> 00:09:22.233
WAS SORT OF UNCONSCIOUSLY

00:09:21.365 --> 00:09:23.201
HUMOROUS, BUT HE HAD A

00:09:22.366 --> 00:09:26.804
REMARKABLE SENSE OF HUMOR.

00:09:23.334 --> 00:09:28.973
AND HERE’S ONE OTHER THING TOO.

00:09:26.938 --> 00:09:30.808
HE TOOK GOD VERY SERIOUSLY, BUT

00:09:29.107 --> 00:09:31.442
HE NEVER, EVER TOOK HIMSELF TOO

00:09:30.942 --> 00:09:34.212
SERIOUSLY.

00:09:31.576 --> 00:09:34.946
AND I THINK THAT GAVE HIM A

00:09:34.345 --> 00:09:37.248
HUMANNESS THAT WAS VERY, VERY

00:09:35.079 --> 00:09:41.052
RELATABLE TO ALL OF US.

00:09:37.382 --> 00:09:43.054
&gt;&gt; Laura: RICK, ON TODAY’S

00:09:41.185 --> 00:09:43.788
WORLD, IT’S A BROKEN WORLD, IT’S

00:09:43.188 --> 00:09:47.892
ALWAYS BEEN BROKEN, BUT LATELY

00:09:43.922 --> 00:09:49.461
WE REALLY SEEM MORE THAN I

00:09:48.026 --> 00:09:50.028
REMEMBER TO BE AT EACH OTHER’S

00:09:49.594 --> 00:09:51.363
THROATS.

00:09:50.161 --> 00:09:54.032
IT’S HARD TO HAVE SEVERAL

00:09:51.496 --> 00:09:54.633
CONVERSATIONS WITH PEOPLE ABOUT

00:09:54.165 --> 00:09:55.700
POLITICS.

00:09:54.766 --> 00:09:56.034
PEOPLE TAKE THINGS OUT OF

00:09:55.834 --> 00:09:57.269
CONTEXT.

00:09:56.167 --> 00:10:00.405
PEOPLE WHO ARE FRIENDS ARE NOT

00:09:57.402 --> 00:10:01.673
TALKING BECAUSE OF POLITICS.

00:10:00.539 --> 00:10:02.240
WHAT WOULD REVEREND GRAHAM

00:10:01.806 --> 00:10:03.642
STATED THAT?

00:10:02.374 --> 00:10:05.444
HE STAYED AWAY FROM POLITICS.

00:10:03.775 --> 00:10:07.612
HE WAS FRIENDS WITH EVERYBODY.

00:10:05.577 --> 00:10:09.948
BUT WHAT WOULD HE SAY ABOUT THE

00:10:07.746 --> 00:10:14.286
TONE AND THE RANCOR TODAY

00:10:10.082 --> 00:10:15.053
ESPECIALLY?

00:10:14.419 --> 00:10:17.689
&gt;&gt; ONE OF THE HALLMARKS OF BILLY

00:10:15.187 --> 00:10:18.523
WAS NOT JUST THE HUMILITY THAT

00:10:17.823 --> 00:10:20.726
THEY MENTIONED, BUT IT WAS HIS

00:10:18.657 --> 00:10:23.128
INTEGRITY ALSO.

00:10:20.859 --> 00:10:26.832
HE WAS SPOTLESS AFTER 60 YEARS.

00:10:23.262 --> 00:10:30.436
THIRD WOULD BE HE WAS A UNITER.

00:10:26.965 --> 00:10:30.803
HE WAS A BUILDER, A BRIDGE

00:10:30.569 --> 00:10:33.639
BUILDER.

00:10:30.936 --> 00:10:35.541
PEOPLE FORGET THAT IN THE ’50s

00:10:33.772 --> 00:10:36.609
AND THE ’60s, BILLY GRAHAM

00:10:35.674 --> 00:10:37.309
INSISTED THAT ALL OF HIS

00:10:36.742 --> 00:10:39.612
CAMPAIGNS AND CRUSADES IN THE

00:10:37.443 --> 00:10:40.613
SOUTH BE INTEGRATED.

00:10:39.745 --> 00:10:42.848
FOR MANY OF THOSE SOUTHERN

00:10:40.746 --> 00:10:45.050
CITIES, THEY WERE THE FIRST

00:10:42.982 --> 00:10:45.751
PUBLICLY INTEGRATED EVENTS IN

00:10:45.184 --> 00:10:48.621
THOSE CITIES WHEN BILLY GRAHAM

00:10:45.885 --> 00:10:51.023
CAME TO TOWN AND HE SAID I’M NOT

00:10:48.754 --> 00:10:51.424
COMING UNLESS THEY ARE

00:10:51.157 --> 00:10:52.825
INTEGRATED.

00:10:51.557 --> 00:10:53.526
NOT ONLY WERE THEY INTEGRATED

00:10:52.958 --> 00:10:58.431
ETHNICALLY AND SKIN COLOR, BUT

00:10:53.659 --> 00:10:59.432
THERE WERE ALSO INTEGRATED WITH

00:10:58.564 --> 00:11:00.433
ALL OF THE DIFFERENT TRADITIONS

00:10:59.565 --> 00:11:01.667
OF CHRISTIANITY.

00:11:00.566 --> 00:11:04.203
HE SAID EVERYBODY’S GOT TO BE AT

00:11:01.801 --> 00:11:07.407
THE TABLE AND HE PUT CATHOLICS

00:11:04.337 --> 00:11:07.974
AND CALVINISTS ON THE STAGE AND

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:10.009
HE PUT PROTESTANTS AND

00:11:08.107 --> 00:11:13.646
PENTECOSTALS ON THE STAGE.

00:11:10.143 --> 00:11:14.647
AND HE PUT CHARISMATICS AND

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:15.615
EVANGELICALS AND FUNDAMENTALS

00:11:14.781 --> 00:11:17.450
AND THEY WERE ALL THERE.

00:11:15.748 --> 00:11:18.284
SOME PEOPLE GOT MAD AT THAT.

00:11:17.583 --> 00:11:24.224
HE SAID I’M NOT COMING IN LESS

00:11:18.418 --> 00:11:25.125
THERE IS UNITY AND OF COURSE IN

00:11:24.357 --> 00:11:27.227
POLITICS ONE OF THE THINGS HE

00:11:25.258 --> 00:11:27.761
TAUGHT ME WAS THAT YOU’VE GOT TO

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:28.561
SHEPHERD EVERYBODY.

00:11:27.894 --> 00:11:30.497
YOU’VE GOT FRIENDS WHO ARE

00:11:28.695 --> 00:11:32.232
REPUBLICANS, FRIENDS OR

00:11:30.630 --> 00:11:35.235
DEMOCRATS, YOU PASTOR THEM ALL.

00:11:32.365 --> 00:11:36.703
YOU DON’T GET CO-OPTED BY ANY

00:11:35.368 --> 00:11:38.238
PARTICULAR PARTISAN GROUP

00:11:36.836 --> 00:11:38.638
BECAUSE HE HAS TO BE ABOVE THE

00:11:38.371 --> 00:11:40.507
FRAY.

00:11:38.772 --> 00:11:46.513
THAT’S WHY HE DID, FOR INSTANCE,

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:48.749
PRAY AND COUNSEL AND SHARE.

00:11:46.646 --> 00:11:49.649
&gt;&gt; Laura: WE ARE OUT OF TIME

00:11:48.882 --> 00:11:50.150
UNFORTUNATELY.

00:11:49.783 --> 00:11:51.251
&gt;&gt; ONE-OF-A-KIND.

